      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moclips%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original 150‑room Moclips Beach Hotel burned down in 1905, just months after opening, and a larger 270‑room hotel with a 2,000‑foot veranda followed in 1907.",
